OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested after six people
OL,4,Afound in lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested after six
OL,7,Fpeople were found in the back of a
OL,8,Florry in Goole, police have said.
OL,10,FHumberside Police were called out to
OL,11,Fthe vehicle on Anderson Road at about
OL,12,F18:00 BST on Tuesday following reports
OL,13,Fof people who were believed to have
OL,14,Fentered the country illegally.
OL,16,FA 27-year-old man and a 24-year-old
OL,17,Fwoman were arrested on suspicion of
OL,18,Fhelping an asylum seeker enter the UK.
OL,19,FBoth remained in custody as inquiries
OL,20,Fcontinued, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
